  "description": "netaera.OpenXml.Excel.SheetMapper is a powerful extension for the netaera.OpenXml.Excel library that enables automated, attribute‑based mapping of Excel data directly to strongly‑typed DTOs. Build robust data import and transformation pipelines for business applications with support for custom type converters and complex data structures.",
